      "w": 400,
      "fill": "green",
      "text": "Decided 21 Oct 2026\n\u2022 Splash: status line, no percentage.\n\u2022 Cards: double-click opens the editor; no detail pane.\n\u2022 Card view (CardView + CardTextBlock) must be reused in the editor preview.\n\u2022 Deck editor: + / \u2212 buttons only, no drag & drop; cards already in the deck are highlighted.\n\u2022 No Settings page; the app is fixed to a dark theme.\n\u2022 Card and deck images are chosen from a local folder in their editors."
    },
